usage: embeddings.py [-h] --output OUTPUT [--platform {cuda,cpu}] [--gpu GPU]
                     [--landmarks LANDMARKS [LANDMARKS ...]]
                     [--validation-size VALIDATION_SIZE]
                     [--candidates CANDIDATES] [--subset-size SUBSET_SIZE]
                     [--repeats REPEATS] [--epsilon EPSILON] [--seed SEED]
                     [--x64] [--smoke]

Regenerate the landmark embedding experiment underlying Figure 4.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT       New JSON output file.
  --platform {cuda,cpu}
  --gpu GPU             Physical GPU index, required for CUDA.
  --landmarks LANDMARKS [LANDMARKS ...]
  --validation-size VALIDATION_SIZE
  --candidates CANDIDATES
  --subset-size SUBSET_SIZE
  --repeats REPEATS
  --epsilon EPSILON
  --seed SEED
  --x64                 Explicit precision variant; the notebook does not
                        enable x64.
  --smoke               Small execution check; not the full paper experiment.
